# Revenue by channel

The first record is the header, and a quoted field carries the delimiter
without ending its cell — which is the only reason RFC 4180 exists.

```mdv bar
title: Revenue by channel
x: channel
y: revenue
format: csv
---
channel,revenue
"Organic, unpaid",48210
Direct,31980
Referral,12440
Paid,8710
```
